    "title": "J.J. Spaun represents Los Angeles at BMW Championship on Sunday, Aug. 23",
    "text": "J.J. Spaun represents Los Angeles at BMW Championship on Sunday, Aug. 23\nBy\nR. E. DobbsLos Angeles, California had representation at the BMW Championship, a PGA Tour event that concluded Sunday, Aug. 23.\nJ.J. Spaun led the city's showing, tying for 22nd with a total of 275, 5 under par.\nSpaun opened with a 64 in Round 1 and followed with rounds of 66, 72 and 73 over the four-day event. The Los Angeles native played collegiately at San Diego State University.\nWyndham Clark won the BMW Championship at 263, 17 under par; Patrick Cantlay was second at 266, 14 under par, and Rory McIlroy was third at 267, 13 under par.",
    "summary": "J.J. Spaun represents Los Angeles at BMW Championship on Sunday, Aug. 23 R. E. DobbsLos Angeles, California had representation at the BMW Championship, a PGA Tour event that concluded Sunday, Aug. 23. J.J. Spaun led the city's showing, tying for 22nd with a total of 275, 5 under par. Spaun opened with a 64 in Round 1 and followed with rounds of 66, 72 and 73 over the four-day event. The Los Angeles native played collegiately at San Diego State University.",
